bel>d</label><p>Geometric standard deviation.</p></fn><fn id="tblfn36"><label>e</label><p>95th percentile.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl9" position="float"><label>Table 9.</label><caption><p>Summary of sulphur dioxide exposure levels by plant and job group, actual concentrations after 6&#x02013;8 h sampling time</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td rowspan="4" colspan="1">Job group</td><td colspan="24" rowspan="1">Sulphur dioxide (p.p.m.)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="8" rowspan="1">Plant A</td><td colspan="8" rowspan="1">Plant B</td><td colspan="8" rowspan="1">Plant C</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td colspan="3" rowspan="1">Maximum peak value<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tblfn37">a</xref></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td colspan="3" rowspan="1">Maximum peak value<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tblfn37">a</xref></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td colspan="3" rowspan="1">Maximum peak value<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tblfn37">a</xref></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>N</italic><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tblfn38">b</xref></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>K</italic><xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tblfn39">c</xref></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">GM</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">GSD<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tblfn40">d</xref></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">GM</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">GM<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tblfn41">e</xref></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">GM</td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1">P95<xref ref-type="table-fn" rid="tblfn42">f</xref></td><td rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>N</italic><xref ref-type="t